Moth name and icon policy

1.  "Moth", the Moth icon and the Moth logo are trade marks of T E Vaughan, whether registered or not.

2.  You may redistribute unmodified official source and builds of Moth free of charge
    under the Moth name and icon.

3.  A modified Fork must use a different name and a different icon. It may say
    truthfully that it is "based on Moth" or "a fork of Moth", but not in a
    way that suggests it is official or endorsed.

4.  You must not use the Moth name or icon to promote anything you charge
    for, except for plain factual statements such as "works with Moth".

5.  "Fork" has the meaning given in the Moth Source-Available Licence. This
    policy is separate from that licence and from the Wumpus Mono Pro
    redistribution permission.

6.  To ask about any other use, email support@getmoth.dev.
